#: terra/templates/terra/home.html:83
msgid ""
"Terra Nova was found the honest way — by an array of telescopes listening\n"
"          for the colour of water. In 2025 the LAGOON survey returned a "
"spectrum that\n"
"          no model could explain away: shallow seas, free oxygen, a "
"magnetosphere\n"
"          holding the line."
msgstr ""
"Terra Nova no hita amin'ny fomba marina — amin'ny kinopy rehetra\n"
"          mifandray amin'ny lokan-dro. Tamin'ny 2025 ny fanadihadiana "
"LAGOON\n"
"          nanome spectre tsy afaka fanenonana amin'ny endrika rehetra:\n"
"          ranomasina ambonin'ny tany, oksizenina malalaka, maginoferosfera\n"
"          mitazona ny lafiny."

#: terra/templates/terra/home.html:89
msgid ""
"So we are going. Not because this world failed, but because a species with\n"
"          one habitat is a species one accident from silence. The first "
"thousand\n"
"          passengers will land at Aurelia Basin with seeds, printers and "
"the\n"
"          patience to do it better."
msgstr ""
"Izao no handehanantsika. Tsy satria taty no tezitra, fa satria\n"
"          velona iray endrika fijiano dia velona iray fe-piainana avy eo "
"amin'ny\n"
"          fiafaram-ponenana. Ny mpandeha tapitrisa voalohany handeha any\n"
"          Aurelia Basin amin'ny voankazo, paosy fanaovana pepero sy ny "
"fahendrena\n"
"          hanao tsara kokoa."

#: terra/templates/terra/home.html:95
msgid ""
"“Terra Nova is not an escape. It is a second draft, written in the same\n"
"          hand — gentler this time.”"
msgstr ""
"« Ny Terra Nova dia tsy fialan-tsiny. Manoratra datra faharoa izy, amin'ny\n"
"          teny iray — amin'ny fomba malefaka kokoa. »"

